  "introTour": "App tour",
  "introTourSubtitle": "How StashTube works: player, shorts and loops, library",
  "introWelcomeTitle": "Welcome to StashTube",
  "introWelcomeText": "Your Stash library, browsed like YouTube. Home shows new and random scenes with filters and sort chips; search finds scenes, images, galleries, performers and studios in one place.",
  "introPlayerTitle": "The player",
  "introPlayerText": "Tap a video to play it; swipe the player down to keep it running in the mini bar. Double-tap the left or right of the video to skip, hold it for 2× speed, pinch to zoom. Open another video from \"Up next\" and the arrows beside play take you back and forth between them.",
  "introShortsTitle": "Shorts and loops",
  "introShortsText": "The Shorts tab has two feeds, switched at its top: Shorts are short (portrait) videos to swipe through. Loops are scene markers, each repeating on its own like a GIF. The tune button picks your favorite tags, the length and \"portrait only\".",
  "introLibraryTitle": "Library and You",
  "introLibraryText": "The library holds all scenes, images and galleries. \"You\" collects your history, watch later, groups, markers, performers, studios, tags and stats. Which tabs the bottom bar shows is up to you, in the settings.",
  "introFavoritesTitle": "Favorites and ratings",
  "introFavoritesText": "Mark performers and studios as favorites and rate them and your scenes with stars. Favorites get their own feed, and long-pressing a tile or tapping its ⋮ shows more actions. You can also edit metadata and create performers, studios, tags and groups.",
  "introSettingsTitle": "Make it yours",
  "introSettingsText": "Your avatar at the top right switches servers and opens the settings: app lock, previews, how thumbnails fit, haptics, playback and more. This tour is there too, under About.",
  "whatsNewTitle": "What's new",
  "whatsNewDone": "Got it",
  "whatsNewSubtitle": "What the latest updates brought",
  "whatsNew1Title": "Loops, a new watch page and more",
  "whatsNew1": "New navigation: Home · Shorts · Search · Library · You.\nLoops: scene markers that repeat on their own. Switch at the top of the Shorts tab.\nA new watch page: rating, O-counter, watch later, marker and more in one bar.\nSearch suggestions while you type.\nDouble tap to skip adds up like on YouTube: 5, 10, 20, 30 seconds …\nBack and forward between the videos you opened, with arrows beside play.\nPerformer and studio pages with tabs: videos, shorts, markers, images, galleries, about.\nFavorites: the newest videos of your favorite performers.",
  "whatsNew1More": "The You tab gathers history, watch later, groups and markers.\nSkip step and counting can be set in Settings → Playback.\nStars and favorites for performers and studios.\nCreate performers, studios and groups.\n\"Full video\" from a short continues where the short was.\nOn tablets the video sits beside \"Up next\".\nPicture-in-picture opens in the video's shape.\nServer tasks: scan, generate, auto tag and clean.\nA check for missing previews.\nA notification when a server task finishes (optional).\nMarkers with a start and an end on newer Stash versions.\n\"New since your last visit\" on the home page.\nClear playback errors with \"Try again\" and \"Change quality\".\nA banner when the server can't be reached; loaded lists stay.\nA simpler login: credentials only when the server asks for them.\nImage details behind the (i) button; swipe down to close an image.\nThe dice on the home page plays a random scene.\nWatch time as a chart in the stats.\nA touch lock in fullscreen.\nA smooth transition into fullscreen.\nOn phones only the player turns sideways; everything else stays upright.\nWhile a short plays, only its main buttons show and its text fades out; pause for the rest.\nPortrait scenes show whole in thumbnails, or filled (settings).\nA tour of the app (Settings → About).\nSettings sorted into categories.",
